---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Services" description="Explore our comprehensive financial services">
  <section class="py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
      <h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-vega-navy mb-12 text-center">Our Services</h1>

      <div class="space-y-12">
        <div class="border-l-4 border-vega-gold pl-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-vega-navy mb-3">Financial Planning</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">
            We develop comprehensive financial plans that align with your life goals. Our advisors work with you to create a roadmap for financial success.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Retirement planning and analysis</li>
            <li>Estate planning strategies</li>
            <li>Tax optimization</li>
            <li>Risk management and insurance review</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-4 border-vega-gold pl-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-vega-navy mb-3">Investment Management</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">
            Our investment strategies are designed to help you build and grow wealth over time. We tailor portfolios to match your risk tolerance and objectives.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Portfolio construction and rebalancing</li>
            <li>Diversification strategies</li>
            <li>Performance monitoring and reporting</li>
            <li>Alternative investment opportunities</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="border-l-4 border-vega-gold pl-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-vega-navy mb-3">Retirement Planning</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-3">
            Planning for retirement requires careful analysis and strategic thinking. We help ensure you have the financial resources for a comfortable retirement.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-600 list-disc list-inside">
            <li>Retirement income projections</li>
            <li>Social Security optimization</li>
            <li>Healthcare and long-term care planning</li>
            <li>Distribution strategies</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-12 text-center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="bg-vega-gold text-vega-navy px-8 py-3 rounded font-bold hover:opacity-90 transition">
          Schedule a Consultation
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
